# Sound effects
@scenario tutorial_lesson_06
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip guide present]
pip: The sfx command plays a sound once. Listen to this example.
[sfx assets/tutorial/welcome.wav]
pip: Find welcome.wav in assets/tutorial. Replay the example to hear it again.
> Review question -> check
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
pip: Which command fits a short sound effect?
> bgm -> retry
> sfx -> correct
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show pip guide curious]
pip: A one-shot sound can finish while the scene continues. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip guide cheer]
pip: A one-shot sound can finish while the scene continues.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_06]
[flag tutorial_done_06]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_3]
